  "bodyHash": "zaWF6dmdDvw=",
  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>此模组需要 </strong></em></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>GECKO LIB！</strong></em></span></a></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p>截至目前，此模组添加了&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>6</em></strong></span> 种炮塔。</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>铁炮塔、金炮塔、钻石炮塔、下界合金炮塔、无人机炮塔和双联炮塔。</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>配方如下</strong></em></span><em><strong>：</strong></em>&nbsp;</p><p>钢锭</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_816c749c-8f9f-4363-8e1c-9a17d8c61582.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"258\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>铁锤（用于右键点击摧毁你的炮塔）</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d06ad624-fe38-4496-be7d-6a5ee6790367.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>电缆&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_0497a79d-52af-4ef5-8469-24d6a3b09587.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"250\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>钢桶&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_2c72d545-7b4f-45ae-8bd3-3d39b13922cd.png\" width=\"545\" height=\"252\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>钢齿轮&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_09f3dcdd-8521-4aad-ab67-5c29a42c73e1.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"254\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>电路&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_eac35715-2cd7-4a6a-9855-13ea12b919b4.png\" width=\"568\" height=\"249\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>铁炮塔</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_350e8b18-ffdf-417c-b19e-dbf3498e45e0.png\" width=\"556\" height=\"257\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>金炮塔&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0d3bf644-bbcf-453d-b233-21d12459dee2.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>钻石炮塔&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fa3900db-23ad-45a7-b652-4290978fa503.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>下界合金炮塔&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b3361839-870b-4ebb-884d-9696221e1f6c.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>无人机炮塔&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_924cbc1e-74f8-4078-9b05-72ba17826987.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"556\" height=\"255\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>双联炮塔</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131666/description_47dd34d1-d801-4676-8a7a-3a92461e327f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"561\" height=\"252\"></p>",
